From: Qianzf <qianzf@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] qca-nss-dp: adapt the driver to mainline 6.18

- get_ts_info takes struct kernel_ethtool_ts_info
- platform .remove returns void, sysctl handlers take a const table
- EEE/RFS steering rely on APIs made private or array-based in 6.18
- from_timer() is timer_container_of() now
- saved_command_line is no longer exported; use the default rings
- explicit vmalloc includes
- stub/replace the QSDK-only helpers (skb fast recycle/xmit, interrupt
  priority, debug memory accounting, ARMv7 dmac_* maintenance)

Signed-off-by: Qianzf <qianzf@example.com>
